+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On the 5,000-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook cost was **11.9 ms
+p50** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that
+change, the measured cost was **1.05 ms p50**.
+
+The latter measurement includes the changes made at the same time: FTS
+coherence on the read path uses the trigger-maintained `meta.fts_rows` counter,
+and the record body limit is enforced by the schema's `CHECK
+(length(body) <= 2000)` constraint. Because these changes landed together, the
+measurement establishes the combined before/after result; it does not isolate
+the contribution of each change.
